1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:53,690
6 months ago

25
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,240
I can't wait any longer.

26
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:04,000
The Ancestor should already be back !

27
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,760
Sima Yan's underlings

28
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,370
are getting more and more restless.

29
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:09,120
It's only a matter of time before they make their move.

30
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,850
Thirteen,

31
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:12,200
I'll ask you one last time.

32
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,600
Are you coming with me ?

33
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:15,370
The Ancestor's order

34
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:17,000
was to wait for his return here.

35
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,770
Stubborn fool !

36
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:20,770
You can stay here and wait for your end,

37
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,760
I'm not staying !

38
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:40,120
Sky Demon Country's Military Law, Article 1.

39
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,400
Those who desert shall be...

40
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:43,880
beheaded.

41
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,930
I'm not a soldier under your command !

42
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:48,320
You can't stop me from returning to my tribe !

43
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:51,880
Stop !

44
00:02:58,040 --> 00:03:00,600
Sky Demon Country's Military Law, Article 8.

45
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,970
Those who revolt against their superior shall be...

46
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:05,050
beheaded !

47
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:08,200
The Ancestor is your Commander !

48
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,600
When he returns,

49
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:11,720
he will deal with you !

50
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:15,600
What a loyal dog you are.

51
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:19,440
It's a pity your useless master has been dismissed from his post.

52
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,720
He won't come to save you !

53
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:30,360
Bastard !

54
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,040
You can kill me,

55
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:34,360
but you can't insult the Ancestor !

56
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:44,000
You're courting death...

57
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:48,200
Sima Yan,

58
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,800
stop this.

59
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:53,290
He Kun
New Commander of the Black Armor Army
Rank 100 000 demonic energy
(Early stage Soul Transformation)

60
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:04,200
How could I get drunk ?

61
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,800
I don't know how long I've slept...

62
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:20,650
Wang Lin's avatar
Peak Late stage
Soul Transformation

63
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,840
My cultivation...

64
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,320
A single drop of this celestial wine

65
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:31,240
made me reach Peak Late stage Soul Transformation...

66
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:33,280
I must carefully keep

67
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:35,120
the remaining 9 drops.

68
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:42,450
I became the master of the celestial cave,

69
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:44,130
had a breakthrough in my cultivation,

70
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:46,440
and obtained Yao Xixue's bags of holding...

71
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,490
I obtained a lot

72
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,680
in this risky trip.

73
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:52,800
With my former cultivation,

74
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:55,640
I wouldn't have been able to break Yao Xixue's Divine Sense so easily.

75
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:58,200
This is...

76
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:01,200
They're all celestial jades !

77
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:03,480
These celestial jades

78
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:06,400
are enough for me to reach Ascendant in a single try.

79
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:13,970
30 minutes later

80
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:14,000
In these 3 bags of holding,

81
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:16,480
besides the thousands of defensive Blood Jades,

82
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,920
and several Blood Soul Pills that might be fake,

83
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:22,240
there's also a Compass to enter and exit this place.

84
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:29,200
Such a powerful killing intent !

85
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,600
Wait...

86
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:33,600
On this bag's restriction,

87
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:36,120
there might be some Divine Sense left by her father.

88
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,520
If an outsider opens it,

89
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:40,840
they will be annihilated by the Divine Sense.

90
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,680
The Blood Ancestor

91
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,720
is very skilled.

92
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:48,320
This teleportation formation looks new,

93
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:51,040
Yao Xixue must have made it recently.

94
00:05:51,840 --> 00:05:55,400
If the Blood Ancestor sent her here to leave a teleportation formation

95
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:58,000
that means reinforcements will come later...

96
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,240
If I erase the formation now,

97
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,930
it might be detected.

98
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:03,720
Then why don't I...

99
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:15,800
If someone really teleports here from the Blood Planet

100
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,800
these restrictions

101
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:20,440
will give them a surprise.

102
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,250
Master is skilled at commanding the army.

103
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,640
Over the past 6 months

104
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:29,240
you convinced the whole Black Armor Army.

105
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:37,120
It seems my army

106
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,480
has changed owners.

107
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,600
Wang Lin !?

108
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:42,730
How...

109
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:44,480
How can he be back ?

110
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,600
Those who dare to charge in my barracks

111
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:48,440
shall be killed on sight !

112
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,200
First Regiment ready !

113
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,640
Second Regiment ready !

114
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,160
Third Regiment ready !

115
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,480
Fourth Regiment ready !

116
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,280
Back down.

117
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,840
What level is this person's cultivation ?

118
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:26,600
Only when facing the Demon General himself

119
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:28,480
did I feel such pressure.

120
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:31,480
What exactly are your intentions ?

121
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:34,200
These are my barracks.

122
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,600
What do you think my intentions are ?

123
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:38,640
You've been missing for over a year,

124
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:41,240
the Demon General has long since dismissed you from your post !

125
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:43,840
So I spent a whole year

126
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,880
in that celestial cave.

127
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,880
Where are my disciples ?

128
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,680
If I don't hold my ground now,

129
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:54,680
I will lose my Commander position.

130
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:10,480
Your turtle shell...

131
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,440
isn't hard enough.

132
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,160
Soul Transformation...

133
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,840
Peak Late stage !

134
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,800
Now answer me.

135
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,400
6 months after you left,

136
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,760
they both disappeared.

137
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:29,600
I don't know where they went !

138
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:32,920
Stop this.

139
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,160
This person is a body cultivator,

140
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:38,040
maybe the Demon General has a use for him.

141
00:08:38,800 --> 00:08:39,790
Master,

142
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:41,800
Hu Pao went missing today.

143
00:08:42,560 --> 00:08:44,120
Fine...

144
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,480
Fine !

145
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:54,800
Where is Thirteen imprisoned ?

146
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:58,280
You mean that savage body cultivator ?

147
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:01,440
The Demon General has ordered

148
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:04,400
to find some people with strong physical bodies.

149
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:07,200
I thought that savage met the criteria

150
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,800
so I sent him to the Demon General's manor.

151
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:11,680
Commander Wang,

152
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,730
you can kill me if you want.

153
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:15,800
I, He Kun, will not even blink.

154
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,720
But if you want that person,

155
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,600
you will have to ask the Demon General directly.

156
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,760
You saved Thirteen's life

157
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,720
then gave him to the Demon General.

158
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,650
Your actions balanced each other out

159
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,040
so I won't kill you.

160
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:37,240
The Demon General went into seclusion half a year ago,

161
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:38,480
he won't receive you !

162
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,040
If you force your way in,

163
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:41,280
you will die for sure !

164
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,720
As expected,

165
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:55,000
the teleportation formations to the Demon General's manor are all closed.

166
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:57,280
To rescue Thirteen,

167
00:09:57,800 --> 00:10:00,800
I must force open the 6 gates of Ancient Demon City.

168
00:10:02,160 --> 00:10:03,880
The Demon General is in seclusion.

169
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,400
This gate is under strict guard.

170
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:07,080
If you take half a step,

171
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:09,170
you will be killed mercilessly !

172
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:11,240
Demon General,

173
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:13,040
Wang Lin requests an audience.

174
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:28,000
I was the one who brought Thirteen and Hu Pao to this Ancient Demon City.

175
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:31,840
My accidental slumber in the celestial cave caused them trouble...

176
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:34,600
It may have already cost them their lives.

177
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:37,240
A cultivator

178
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,080
should avoid conflict

179
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,530
and embrace the heavens.

180
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:43,920
Killing my way through, forcing the gates open,

181
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,400
defying the Demon General,

182
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:47,850
and breaking the Military Law for someone I barely know

183
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,480
isn't worth it...

184
00:10:50,880 --> 00:10:52,600
But when feelings are implicated,

185
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,720
things that aren't worth it...

186
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:57,040
are worth it.

187
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:02,400
Fire arrows !

188
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:04,890
I, Wang Lin, walk between heaven and earth

189
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:06,600
neither seeking to follow rules

190
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:08,720
nor seeking to follow the Dao.

191
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,480
I only seek a life

192
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,640
where I don't have regrets !

193
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,850
Someone is forcing their way in !

194
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:16,400
Quick, inform the Commanders !

195
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:18,880
This is the Demon Spirit Crystal Junior found in the other tribe.

196
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,360
I offer it to you, Celestial.

197
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,490
Anyone who disrespects the Ancestor

198
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,120
is an enemy.

199
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,920
You can kill me,

200
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:28,120
but you can't insult the Ancestor !

201
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:30,040
Bound by human emotions...

202
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,800
Bound by obsessions...

203
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:35,200
Perhaps I'm not suited for cultivation.

204
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:38,040
But since this obsession is here,

205
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:40,000
I must deal with it.

206
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:45,440
If I don't save Thirteen now,

207
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:48,970
then everything I, Wang Lin, have sought all my life

208
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:51,400
will become meaningless.

209
00:11:57,640 --> 00:11:58,920
Charge !

210
00:12:09,280 --> 00:12:10,400
Audacious !

211
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:12,840
The Demon General is in seclusion !

212
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:13,800
Wang Lin,

213
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:15,600
what exactly are you doing !?

214
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:17,400
I want to see the Demon General

215
00:12:17,560 --> 00:12:20,010
to demand an explanation for Thirteen.

216
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:22,280
Are you insane !?

217
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,480
Destroying our city gates,

218
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:26,040
breaking our Military Law,

219
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:28,890
making an enemy of the entire Ancient Demon City...

220
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:31,880
for an ant-like follower !?

221
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:34,040
You've got some nerve !

222
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:37,570
Li Tao
First Commander of Ancient Demon City
Rank 150 000 Demonic Energy 
(Late stage Soul Transformation)

223
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:36,600
Since you remain so stubborn,

224
00:12:36,640 --> 00:12:38,040
then today

225
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:40,600
will be your last day !

226
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,120
Die !

227
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:52,160
Underworld Finger !

228
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,200
He's here.

229
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:27,440
Peak Late stage Soul Transformation ?

230
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:29,200
Your finger spell

231
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,640
isn't bad.

232
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:33,370
But it's not enough to absolve you

233
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,480
of the death penalty !

234
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:37,840
Demon General,

235
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:39,760
long time no see.

236
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:02,400
Withstand my Hundred Waves Demon Sea

237
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:07,120
and then you'll be qualified to talk with me !

238
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:15,520
The power of this Hundred Waves Demon Sea

239
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:18,240
far surpasses the Ten Collapse Battle Intent.

240
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:20,080
Can you withstand it ?

241
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:22,320
Show me your true strength !

242
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,080
This is...

243
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:35,800
the golden symbol ?

244
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:38,600
Why does my soul shake so violently

245
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:41,120
as is if it were about to burst out of my body ?

246
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:43,880
The golden symbol activating on its own now

247
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:46,000
must be some kind of life-protecting spell.

248
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:48,440
This spell comes from the celestial cave...

249
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:51,200
Why don't I let it free ?

250
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:53,720
It might be able to resist the Hundred Waves Demon Sea.

251
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:11,040
This move consumes too much of the Life Seals,

252
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:13,200
it's difficult to use continuously.

253
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:16,840
Good !

254
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,400
Wang Lin,

255
00:15:18,800 --> 00:15:20,400
I underestimated you.

256
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:24,080
It seems this golden symbol still has many variations.

257
00:15:24,760 --> 00:15:26,720
Use them all now !

258
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:28,840
Let us have a hearty battle !

259
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,320
Thirteen...

260
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:32,130
Where is he !?

261
00:15:33,680 --> 00:15:35,200
We'll talk after this !

262
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:37,200
Hundred Waves, Rumbling Thunder,

263
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:38,880
Raging Tides !

264
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,200
Attack !

265
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:59,000
Whether it's the Ten Collapse Battle Intent or the Hundred Waves Demon Sea,

266
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:01,000
this person's spells

267
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:04,000
are all based on that unyielding faith in his battle intent.

268
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:07,640
It will be hard to win with my spells.

269
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,400
It seems...

270
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:12,130
I only have a single move to gamble on.

271
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:16,800
Since you pushed me this far,

272
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:18,640
once I use my final ace,

273
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:20,240
you will die for sure.

274
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:22,040
If you can really kill me,

275
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:24,200
then I will be satisfied !

276
00:16:25,560 --> 00:16:27,600
I have cultivated for many years,

277
00:16:27,760 --> 00:16:31,400
but I've never seen anyone who could withstand this move.

278
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:36,200
It's unfortunate for this talented young man...

279
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:39,890
He thought he could force his way with just his cultivation.

280
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:42,400
Little does he know that the Demon General's power

281
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:44,600
is far more than just cultivation.

282
00:16:44,560 --> 00:16:45,880
This kid...

283
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:48,400
has brought this upon himself.

284
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:02,240
This is...

285
00:17:06,760 --> 00:17:09,040
Using the power of the Celestial Realm's palmprint,

286
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:12,320
I will break your unyielding faith !

287
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:32,680
This spell...

288
00:17:33,360 --> 00:17:36,090
you haven't mastered it completely, have you ?

289
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:38,600
Do you...

290
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:41,120
want to try again ?

291
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:46,120
If a spell like this

292
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:49,200
were used by a Soul Transformation cultivator,

293
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:51,720
it would definitely cause an immense backlash.

294
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:55,040
That's the reason he only manifested an illusory palm.

295
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:58,000
In just a single year,

296
00:17:57,760 --> 00:18:00,600
this guy's cultivation can already rival mine.

297
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:03,600
His spells are even more unfathomable.

298
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:05,520
Demon General Mo,

299
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:08,040
can you tell me now

300
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:10,920
where Thirteen is ?

301
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:14,400
No need to be so distant.

302
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:15,640
Brother Wang,

303
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:18,280
from now on we will call each other brothers.

304
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,800
I was in seclusion

305
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:22,400
in order to refine people with strong physical bodies.

306
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:24,480
Your follower was scheduled for later

307
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:25,880
and hasn't been refined yet.

308
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:28,320
I can return him to you

309
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:30,320
but I can't overlook what you did today

310
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:32,280
by destroying the city

311
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:34,520
and killing my soldiers.

312
00:18:35,840 --> 00:18:37,400
What do you want ?

313
00:18:37,360 --> 00:18:39,000
In 3 months,

314
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:41,400
in Sky Demon City, the capital of the Sky Demon Country,

315
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:43,680
there will be a competition

316
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:45,800
between all the Demon Generals.

317
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:47,320
Brother Wang,

318
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:49,200
I want you to assist me.

319
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:52,920
Although this person is domineering,

320
00:18:53,440 --> 00:18:55,600
I can feel he's genuine.

321
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:57,440
Agreed.

322
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:00,840
From now on,

323
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:02,320
Wang Lin

324
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:04,800
is my, Mo Lihai's, First Vice-General !

325
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:09,840
If I win the Demon General Competition,

326
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:13,040
I will ask the Demon Emperor to name you his General !

327
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:15,200
You will command hundreds of thousands

328
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,600
and rule a city !

329
00:19:21,120 --> 00:21:25,610
"This move consumes too much of the Life Seals, it's difficult to use continuously."
This phrase is donghua original and makes very little sense. The Life Seals of the Celestial Slaughter Art have nothing to do with the golden symbols from the celestial cave.

330
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:32,610
I've been walking this path for endless years

331
00:19:29,020 --> 00:19:32,610
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

332
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:38,210
Is it the compass of fate

333
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:38,210
that wrote this outcome for us ?

334
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:44,130
The heavens want to erase your existence,

335
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:49,850
that's the obsession guiding me.

336
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:55,450
Is this the path to uncover

337
00:19:51,760 --> 00:19:55,450
truths from falsehoods ?

338
00:19:55,480 --> 00:20:01,050
In a world of murk and shadow,

339
00:19:57,380 --> 00:20:01,050
only the flame of truth can light the way.

340
00:20:00,840 --> 00:20:06,770
Look at them all,

341
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:06,770
being carried by the waves.

342
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:11,410
Look at them all,

343
00:20:09,120 --> 00:20:11,410
being drowned.

344
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:14,730
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

345
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:17,810
I will let the world refine my soul.

346
00:20:17,690 --> 00:20:23,370
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

347
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:23,370
I will fight.

348
00:20:23,120 --> 00:20:26,490
I'll break through the abyss of despair

349
00:20:26,240 --> 00:20:29,530
to finally learn who I really am.

350
00:20:29,280 --> 00:20:34,890
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

351
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:34,890
I embrace this obsession.

352
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:37,850
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

353
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:40,650
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

354
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:46,130
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

355
00:20:42,440 --> 00:20:46,130
I'll still fight.

356
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:49,490
It's hard to avoid loneliness

357
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:52,530
when you are above everyone else.

358
00:20:52,280 --> 00:20:58,210
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

359
00:20:54,600 --> 00:20:58,210
be afraid of a firefly ?

360
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:04,290
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

361
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:07,010
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

362
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:10,410
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

363
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:13,210
why the world is a-changing.

364
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:16,610
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

365
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:20,130
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

366
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:23,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

367
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:26,090
I will defy the light in the sky

368
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:29,810
to continue to write a new chapter
for all things in the three realms of existence.

369
00:11:38,160 --> 00:11:41,730
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

370
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:44,930
Transform your insignificant body into light.

371
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:48,130
The hardships of the journey

372
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:50,890
will temper this young man's heart.

373
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:54,610
The path to immortality is rugged and arduous,
yet I cling to dreams of the past.

374
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:06,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal,
will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
